{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1484,1544p' docs/design/yin.vm.linker.md | nl -ba -v 1484\"","aggregated_output":"  1484\t## 13. Reconciliation record\n  1485\t\n  1486\t### 13.1 Revision r3 (round 2, `gpt-6-sol`)\n  1487\t\n  1488\tThe round-2 review verified round-1 items 1, 7, 9a to 9e, and 10 as\n  1489\tclosed and marked seven items partial plus one ordering defect. Each,\n  1490\tand what r3 did:\n  1491\t\n  1492\t| Item                              | Resolution                        |\n  1493\t|-----------------------------------|-----------------------------------|\n  1494\t| Wire request example carried both | Agreed. Two mutually exclusive    |\n  1495\t| name and identity; refusal table  | examples; both-or-neither is      |\n  1496\t| lacked `:invalid-request`         | `:invalid-request`; reason added  |\n  1497\t|                                   | to the table at step 0 (4.3, 6.3).|\n  1498\t| Module-local definitions flagged  | Agreed. `:definitions-fn` yields  |\n  1499\t| as `:undeclared-free`             | the constant-key definition set,  |\n  1500\t|                                   | subtracted before the join; also  |\n  1501\t|                                   | gives an early `:export-missing`  |\n  1502\t|                                   | (4.1, 4.2 step 5a, 5.x records).  |\n  1503\t| VM-local counters collide on one  | Agreed. Link id is `[origin       |\n  1504\t| response stream                   | counter]`; origin minted per task |\n  1505\t|                                   | by the scheduler owning the pair; |\n  1506\t|                                   | multiplexed schedulers need       |\n  1507\t|                                   | distinct prefixes (7.2 step 3).   |\n  1508\t| Exported closures carry child     | Agreed. `linked` is load, lift to |\n  1509\t| code coordinates                  | UCF closure markers relative to   |\n  1510\t|                                   | the image identity, lower against |\n  1511\t|                                   | the parent's alias column or      |\n  1512\t|                                   | offset (7.3). Divergence: export  |\n  1513\t|                                   | relocation chosen over execution  |\n  1514\t|                                   | in the owning child, which would  |\n  1515\t|                                   | be a cross-VM function call.      |\n  1516\t| `:fallback :verifying` could      | Agreed. `:derivation` policy is   |\n  1517\t| accept an unverified claim        | `:verifying` or `:trusted`;       |\n  1518\t|                                   | verifying fetches the tree and    |\n  1519\t|                                   | re-lowers under the exact         |\n  1520\t|                                   | per-format profile or refuses     |\n  1521\t|                                   | `:unverified-derivation`; it      |\n  1522\t|                                   | never downgrades (8.1, 6.2).      |\n  1523\t| Bare `:asserted-by` honored       | Agreed. Proof required: a         |\n  1524\t|                                   | signature over canonical bytes    |\n  1525\t|                                   | verified by a composition-        |\n  1526\t|                                   | supplied function, or an attested |\n  1527\t|                                   | one-writer log bound to the       |\n  1528\t|                                   | principal at attachment; unproven |\n  1529\t|                                   | is `:unauthenticated`; retraction |\n  1530\t|                                   | needs matching proof (8.2). Key   |\n  1531\t|                                   | management stays open (12).       |\n  1532\t| Host modules implied a sandbox    | Agreed. The host module is named  |\n  1533\t|                                   | the trusted composition boundary; |\n  1534\t|                                   | the profile check is a declaration|\n  1535\t|                                   | check; run-time confinement is    |\n  1536\t|                                   | the capability-token discipline,  |\n  1537\t|                                   | outside the linker (8.3).         |\n  1538\t| Contract checked after row-local  | Agreed; r2 ordering defect. The   |\n  1539\t| validation                        | contract check is step 0, before  |\n  1540\t|                                   | any fetch or validator, and is    |\n  1541\t|                                   | repeated against the manifest's   |\n  1542\t|                                   | contract before any image fetch   |\n  1543\t|                                   | (4.2 step 0, 8.1).                |\n  1544\t\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
